                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6731/106: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-18T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1928—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>51. Your 74, May 17, 9 p.m. There is no objection to the modifications proposed
                    by the Minister of Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
